KustoLoco.UserAgent
===================

This package embeds the user-agent regular-expression dataset "regexes.yaml" from the
ua-parser / uap-core project:

    https://github.com/ua-parser/uap-core

uap-core is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

A copy of the dataset is embedded unmodified. The parsing cascade in this package is an
original implementation of the uap-core specification and is licensed under the MIT License,
consistent with the rest of KustoLoco.

